# LLM Framework

## Three-Tier Model Strategy

| Tier | Model | Price (in/out per M) | When |
|---|---|---|---|
| Free | Ollama `nomic-embed-text` (local) | $0 | All embeddings, dedup, semantic search |
| Bulk | Gemini 2.5 Flash (`google/gemini-2.5-flash`) | $0.30 / $2.50 | Signal classification, article summaries |
| Analysis | Kimi K2 (`moonshotai/kimi-k2`) | $0.55 / $2.20 | Briefs, emails, battle cards, digest |

## Budget: $15 Total

- Collection runs (bulk): ~$0.15/run × ~30 runs = ~$4.50
- Analysis (briefs, emails, digest): ~$0.05/request × ~100 = ~$5.00
- Buffer for iteration/testing: ~$5.50

## Module-to-Tier Map

- `ai/embeddings.py` → Free (Ollama)
- `ai/summarizer.py` → Bulk (`call_bulk()`)
- `ai/signal_extractor.py` → Bulk (`call_bulk()`)
- `ai/brief_generator.py` → Analysis (`call_with_fallback()`)
- `api/main.py` digest → Analysis (`call_with_fallback()`)
- `collectors/*.py` → Free (dedup) + Bulk (if classifying)

## Rules for New AI Calls

- Collection/enrichment pipelines → always bulk tier
- User-facing generation (cached) → always analysis tier
- Embeddings → always Ollama, never OpenRouter
- Every LLM call must have a keyword-based fallback that works with no API key
- Never hardcode model names — read from `config.py` env vars
- Bulk tier falls back to keyword extraction on failure — never escalates to analysis tier

## Client API

```python
from ai.client import get_ai_client, call_bulk, call_with_fallback

client = get_ai_client()
call_bulk(client, messages)           # Gemini Flash, falls back to keywords
call_with_fallback(client, messages)  # K2, falls back to Gemini Flash
```

## Buyer Journey Signal Map

```
NEED DETECTED → BUDGET AVAILABLE → ACTIVELY EVALUATING → DEAL
```

| Signal Type | Buyer Stage | Best For | Primary Collectors |
|---|---|---|---|
| hiring | Need Detected | AI Cloud, Colo | ATS (Greenhouse/Lever), HN, Google News |
| ai_initiative | Need Detected | AI Cloud | ArXiv, GitHub, news, cloud blogs |
| cloud_spend | Need Detected | Colo | Earnings calls, cloud blogs |
| fundraising | Budget Available | AI Cloud, BTS | Funding collector, SEC, HN |
| funding_completed | Budget Available | AI Cloud, BTS | Funding collector, SEC, HN |
| outgrowing | Actively Evaluating | All | HN, earnings calls, news |
